      "unique_index": 0,
      "cn_text": "没想到CIA和KGB竟然会联手，真让我吃惊。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 54,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 1,
      "cn_text": "没想到连支局长级别的人都会合作……我倒听说过，现场的情报人员彼此会混个脸熟。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 114,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_OVERSTATES_FRIENDLY_RELATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 2,
      "cn_text": "是这样吗？",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 15,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 3,
      "cn_text": "情报活动的舞台，当然都会是政治上的热点地区。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 66,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 4,
      "cn_text": "不过，这样的地方很有限。尤其是在小国。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 57,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 5,
      "cn_text": "要是经常往那些地方跑，彼此就算不愿意也难免会碰面吧。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 78,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 6,
      "cn_text": "久而久之会开始打招呼，再一起吃饭……",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 54,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 7,
      "cn_text": "说不定还会开出爱情之花？",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 36,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_SEMANTIC_DRIFT_IGNORED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 8,
      "cn_text": "这我就不知道了。总之，这场闹剧或许就是那种过度熟络发展到最后的结果。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 102,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 9,
      "cn_text": "没想到还有些人，只要利害一致，连忠义都能抛弃……",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 72,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 10,
      "cn_text": "能够诉诸感情，是<R=人力情报,ヒュミント>的优势；但同时也会被感情牵绊，这也是它的弱点。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "<R=人力情报,ヒュミント>",
